        [0.215, 0.345, 0.63, 0.575, 0.575, 0.65],
        [0.22, 0.36, 0.64, 0.6, 0.6, 0.65],
        [0.225, 0.375, 0.65, 0.625, 0.625, 0.65]
      ],
      "icon": "icon/skill/1209_talent.png",
      "maxLevel": 15,
      "summary": {
        "en": "During \"Soulsteel Sync\", reduces the chance of this character being attacked and increases their CRIT Rate and CRIT DMG. After attacking an enemy, there is a chance of launching a Follow-Up ATK, dealing Ice DMG with a chance to Freeze the target.\n\"Soulsteel Sync\" will be removed after this character receives damage.",
        "zh-CN": "处于【智剑连心】时受到攻击的概率降低，自身暴击率和暴击伤害提高。对敌方目标施放攻击后，有概率发动追加攻击，对其造成冰属性伤害并有概率使其陷入冻结状态。\n自身受到伤害后，【智剑连心】消失。"
      },
      "typeText": { "en": "Talent", "zh-CN": "天赋" },
